  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"If I find you, I will turn you into a beautiful bird that only looks at me.\"*\n\nElla, a maid in the Drois Palace. She had only wanted an ordinary and simple life, but after finding an old music box while cleaning a warehouse, she begins to have secret and dangerous dreams every night.\n\n *\"What on earth are you?\"\n\n\"A monster that will eat you.\"* \n\nThe moment Ella realizes that the man in her dreams is the emperor, Carlyle, known as the tyrant, she decides to run away to protect herself. \n\n*\"Ella, I will decorate a beautiful birdcage for you.\"*\n\nNot knowing that there is only one ending that awaits her at the end.\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
